{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1202926-quick-lore-question-on-db-wfhw","id":1202926,"title":"Quick Lore question on DB:WFHW","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-04T03:00:57-07:00","id":1202926,"title":"Quick Lore question on DB:WFHW","content":"Kingfisher Swift is described as taking the &quot;coin&quot; instead of the &quot;razor&quot;. Presumably this means enforced military service but does anyone have any more solid info about it? My Dragonblood knowledge is pretty weak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T03:08:05-07:00","id":1202927,"title":"","content":"Yeah, you go to Pasiap's Stair to train to be an officer in the Realm's Legion. You have to do 50 years of military service in the legions, then you're free to do whatever in the Realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T03:14:38-07:00","id":1202929,"title":"","content":"The razor and the coin is a popular idiom for the careers that the Realm offers to outcastes. The coin symbolizes the prospects of what they might earn in the legions, and the razor refers to how becoming an Immaculate monk will include shaving their heads.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T03:28:06-07:00","id":1202934,"title":"","content":"My Terrestrials~ Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T04:30:16-07:00","id":1202945,"title":"","content":"From what is written on the previews, it is not just an idiom. The outcaste is actually presented the two objects in a ceremony;<br /> <br /> &quot;At the end of this year, the grandest feast of their young life takes place, the Feast of the Elect. It\u2019s here that the Humble and Munificent Master of Orphans offers each child in turn two silver platters. One holds an elaborately filigreed razor of jade, symbolizing the bald head of an Immaculate monk; the other, an ornamental jade obol, stamped on one side with the image of the Empress to symbolize personal loyalty to the throne \u2014 representing payment for military service. In the morning, they leave for their destinations, and the future that awaits.&quot;<br /> <br /> I dunno if they get to keep the specific razor or coin used in their ceremony, but, and I might be tripping, I read somewhere (or it was just me imagining a DB staring at the physical representation of his choice, ruminating) how a Pasiap's Stair graduate held on to his coin or something like that, if a Dev could clarify, it would be a cool little lore nugget.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T06:48:18-07:00","id":1202978,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I recalled that element of the process after I wrote that. Might still qualify as idiomatic, technically, but never mind","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}